<title>NETHERLANDS: Philips 9 months sales/income per sector.</title>
<headline>Philips 9 months sales/income per sector.</headline>
<dateline>EINDHOVEN, Netherlands 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>SALES PER SECTOR (billions of guilders)</p>
<p>    Lighting				 6.40  vs   6.16</p>
<p>    Consumer products		   17.16  vs  16.00</p>
<p>    Components and semiconductors   11.71  vs  10.68</p>
<p>    Professional products,systems    8.05  vs   8.03</p>
<p>    Software and services		8.27  vs   6.83</p>
<p>    Miscellaneous			  2.77  vs   3.00</p>
<p>    Intra-company deliveries	   6.57  vs   6.09</p>
<p>    Total sales			   47.79  vs  44.59</p>
<p>INCOME PER SECTOR</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Lighting				  653  vs   735</p>
<p>    Consumer products		loss  10  vs   287 profit</p>
<p>    Components/semiconductors (bln)  1.19  vs   1.70</p>
<p>    Professional products/systems loss 79  vs    26 loss</p>
<p>    Software and services		 291  vs   480</p>
<p>    Miscellaneous			   179  vs   266</p>
<p>    Non-allocated costs		   701  vs   654</p>
<p>    Total income from ops (billions) 1.52  vs   2.79</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
